[voice path="res://Assets/Audio/VA/Sutherland/Operational.mp3" volume="0.0" bus="Character Voice"]
Sutherland: I'm operational.
[voice path="res://Assets/Audio/VA/Smith/Unsavory-Folks.mp3" volume="0.0" bus="Character Voice"]
Smith: Oh thank god. I was beginning to think you'd... well, never mind. It's good to hear from you. Be careful out there. I've had some unsavory folks trying to slip through the cracks lately.
Narrator: As he finishes, the radio crackles and a new voice can be heard.
"Scottish Fisherman": Fair Isle South, Fair Isle South, this is fishing vessel Salty Lass, Salty Lass. Do you need, over?
[voice path="res://Assets/Audio/VA/Sutherland/Aye all clear.mp3" volume="0.0" bus="Character Voice"]
Sutherland: Aye, all clear for docking. We'll light the way sailor. Over.